<http://data.silknow.org/object/e746f3db-56df-3b4c-9e07-77e39c8536cf>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "\"The Turf Inn\" pattern. Right and left selvages intact. No seams; top and bottom edges hemmed. cotton printed by copper plate, sepia color. Repeat shows rural sporting scene with an inn, bearing sign \"The Turf Inn,\" in the lower left, with a carriage and horses in the center. Above are three horses and riders engaged in a race, spectators in background. Horizontal stain through right center. Condition generally good."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/5a7e2b85-7d76-37a5-8b58-3f27a612734a> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "\"The Turf Inn\" pattern. Right and left selvages intact. No seams; top and bottom edges hemmed. cotton printed by copper plate, sepia color. Repeat shows rural sporting scene with an inn, bearing sign \"The Turf Inn,\" in the lower left, with a carriage and horses in the center. Above are three horses and riders engaged in a race, spectators in background. Horizontal stain through right center. Condition generally good."@en ;
